  "changes": "Extracted cooperative TCgen05 Indexer and exact Top-K for SM103. Adapted BF16/FP8 native paged caches, causal lengths, FastLLM quantization/scale order and caller-owned scratch. Partial fusion retains score ordering and native attention arithmetic. Full layer adds native BF16 projections/RoPE/cache append, compact attention, token-ordered bitmap Top-K, seven cache producer warps, conditional first-histogram reuse and TP8 residual output. For intermediate lengths, full-layer Top-K partitions each query across resident CTAs and scatters winners in token order using existing scratch. Removed unused upstream helpers, phase timers and unreachable histogram variants. The internal full-layer launch ABI/control flow is retained to preserve measured SM103 code generation. See README.txt for support, fallback and numerical contracts.",
